      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>LuAngel Special Pets Health Center is focused on improving the quality of life for animals with special needs, including pets with medical conditions, disabilities, behavioral issues, and advanced age. Our mission is to provide compassionate, personalized care while easing the emotional and financial burden on pet owners by offering affordable services such as mobile grooming, boarding, daycare, and community education. We are committed to reducing the number of unnecessary euthanasia cases by supporting vulnerable pets and helping them live longer, healthier, and more dignified lives.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>In 2023, the organization was in its early operational phase after receiving tax-exempt status in late 2022. Most efforts were focused on building the website, promoting services, setting up internal systems, and preparing to provide consistent care. During that year, LuAngel provided grooming, boarding, and daycare services specifically for animals with special needs. These services were offered at no cost or for a small fee to pet owners who often could not afford the higher rates typically charged for special needs care. While operations were limited, this work reflected our mission to support vulnerable animals, and it laid the foundation for significant growth in 2024.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
